  "content": "<h1><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/gFLGx3BS/asgard.png\" alt=\"標題\" width=\"1035\" height=\"115\"></h1><h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/6cC4yfgL/img.png\" alt=\"阿斯嘉蒲公英\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\">來自1.12.2和1.7.10模組包的經典阿斯嘉蒲公英即將回歸新版！</h1><h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_daf3a22e-98be-42c5-8113-1036a877e6fc.png\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\"> 這個附加模組將三個等級的阿斯嘉蒲公英重新帶回新版的Minecraft中。</h3><p>&nbsp;</p><h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/xtkcbBqr/image.png\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\"> 第一級 :: 每刻產生1,000,000魔力且永不凋零。</h3><h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/LXGVr4zg/image.png\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\"> 第二級 :: 每刻產生2,500,000魔力且永不凋零。</h3><h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/ptpgCLp/image.png\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\"> 第三級 :: 每刻產生10,000,000魔力且永不凋零。<br><br></h3><h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1435540/description_9cbe0a6f-2e4a-421e-a692-69669d2ca0e8.png\"><strong>注意：這個附加模組能幫助你儲存如此大量的魔力：</strong></h1><h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/improved-botania-pools\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_3a72faee-1132-4624-87f6-2e112dbab3e8.png\"> <strong>改進魔力池</strong></a></h3><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/XdLc51V/image.png\" alt=\"主圖\" width=\"1440\" height=\"775\"></h3><h3 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h3><p>&nbsp;</p><h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_0987cc7c-f2be-462e-bf01-59e6c8506fdc.png\" width=\"27\" height=\"27\">在無盡貪婪極限合成桌中有專屬合成配方</h3><p>&nbsp;</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/dwmsr4WG/image.png\" width=\"796\" height=\"688\"></p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/hR0vXX6s/image.png\" width=\"796\" height=\"688\"></p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/qZL9Qsd/image.png\" width=\"796\" height=\"688\"></p>\n</div><h3 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h3>",
